"net_amount\":216000,\"basis\":\"R-02 2027.1 Treaty rate (10%) under US-Luxembourg treaty. Form F-006 (W-8BEN-E with valid treaty claim to LU, valid to 2027-12-31). Clearance CL-006 cleared, valid to 2027-12-31. Change case K-006 open (restructuring 2026-08-01, learned 2026-08-18) - monitor closure.\"},{\"recipient_no\":\"I-007\",\"component\":\"D-002-A\",\"outcome\":\"cleared\",\"gross_amount\":480000,\"withholding_rate\":30,\"tax_withheld\":144000,\"net_amount\":336000,\"basis\":\"R-01 2026.1 Statutory rate (30%). Forms F-007, F-013 (W-8IMY, no treaty claim). Clearance CL-007 status 'admittedWithOpenItems' (valid to 2028-12-31) with default treatment '30% on undocumented owner share'. Missing fact MF-001: Owner I-014 (37.5% share) lacks tax certification. Monitor I-014 documentation.\"},{\"recipient_no\":\"I-008\",\"component\":\"D-002-A\",\"outcome\":\"cleared\",\"gross_amount\":480000,\"withholding_rate\":10,\"tax_withheld\":48000,\"net_amount\":432000,\"basis\":\"R-02 2027.1 Treaty rate (10%) under US-Luxembourg treaty. Form F-008 (W-8BEN-E with valid treaty claim to LU, valid to 2027-12-31). Clearance CL-008 cleared, valid to 2027-12-31.\"},{\"recipient_no\":\"I-009\",\"component\":\"D-002-A\",\"outcome\":\"cleared\",\"gross_amount\":80000,\"withholding_rate\":30,\"tax_withheld\":24000,\"net_amount\":56000,\"basis\":\"R-01 2026.1 Statutory rate (30%). Form F-009 (W-8BEN-E, no treaty claim, resident of CH, valid to 2028-12-31). Clearance CL-009 cleared, valid to 2028-12-31.\"},{\"recipient_no\":\"I-015\",\"component\":\"D-002-A\",\"outcome\":\"defaultRate\",\"gross_amount\":400000,\"withholding_rate\":30,\"tax_withheld\":120000,\"net_amount\":280000,\"basis\":\"R-01 2026.1 Default statutory rate (30%). Form F-015 (W-8BEN-E, treaty claim LU) EXPIRED on 2025-12-31. No renewal received. Clearance CL-015 was valid only to 2025-12-31; new clearance CL-015W WITHDRAWN effective 2026-01-01. Case K-015 (renewal) closed 2026-01-01 with outcome 'withdrawn: no reply before