he form ended\\\"\\n   - Missing fact MF-002 recorded: \\\"Form F-015 ended on 31 December 2025 and no new form was received\\\"\\n   - Cannot be cured before payment date\\n   - Applied default rate of 30% per R-01 2026.1\\n   - **Action:** Notify investor of default rate and requirement to provide renewed W-8BEN-E or equivalent documentation to restore treaty rate. Flag for investigation if renewal was requested but not received.\\n\\n4. **I-007 (Sterling Nominees) — Open Items:**\\n   - Clearance CL-007 status: \\\"admittedWithOpenItems\\\" \\n   - Default treatment: \\\"30% default rate on the share of the undocumented owner\\\"\\n   - Missing fact MF-001: Owner I-014 (37.5% share) lacks tax certification\\n   - Form F-007 (W-8IMY) has no treaty claim\\n   - Applied 30% withholding per rule and clearance default treatment\\n   - **Action:** Monitor for documentation of owner I-014; may support reduced rate on 62.5% documented share in future distributions, subject to separate clearance review.\\n\\n5. **I-006 (Meridian Holdings I) — Change Case Open:**\\n   - Change case K-006 remains open as of today (2026-10-15)\\n   - Triggered by restructuring: Meridian Holdings II now holds 30% of Meridian Holdings I (occurred 2026-08-01, learned 2026-08-18)\\n   - Clearance CL-006 and form F-006 remain valid to 2027-12-31\\n   - Restructuring occurred before distribution record date; holdings as at record date should reflect the change\\n   - Included in cleared line\\n   - **Action:** Monitor case K-006 closure; if closed with open items, may require re-assessment of withholding in future distributions.\\n\\n6. **Reconciliation:** \\n   - Total gross: USD 8,000,000 ✓\\n   - Total withheld: USD 1,319,900\\n   - Total net: USD 6,680,100 ✓\\n   - Totals reconcile to distribution notice DOC-0202\\n\\n7. **Second Review:** All reduced rates (10% for Luxembourg residents), default rate (I-015), and open items (I-007) require second review and sign-off per control C3.3 and C3.5 before release.\\n\\n8. **Investor Notification Required:** Before payment, notify I-015 (Bertrange Capital) of default rate application and deadline for documentation renewal. Include reference to missing fact MF-002 and case K-015 closure.\\n\\n9. **Release Gate:** This schedule may be released only after second review sign-off and execution of notifications per control C3.7.\"}",
